# 🌱 AI-Based Crop Disease Prediction System

## MyAgri | IBM PBEL AI Solution

This project develops an AI-based crop disease prediction system
using Machine Learning and Deep Learning.

The system analyzes crop leaf images and predicts the corresponding
disease class using a transfer-learning approach with EfficientNet-B0.

### Objectives

- Analyze and validate the PlantVillage dataset
- Detect corrupted and duplicate images
- Analyze class distribution
- Create leakage-aware train/validation/test splits
- Apply image preprocessing and augmentation
- Train an EfficientNet-B0 classifier
- Evaluate model performance
- Generate confusion matrix and classification metrics
- Save the best trained model

### Dataset

PlantVillage is used for initial model development and benchmarking.

The dataset contains approximately 54,000 labeled plant-leaf images
covering multiple crops and disease categories.

### Important

This project is intended for research, educational and preliminary
crop-disease screening purposes. Predictions should not be treated
as a definitive agricultural diagnosis.
